    ":question/problem": "Find the value of $\\left(x^4\\right)^5.$",
    ":question/worked-solution": "We multiply the exponents, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\\left(x^4\\right)^5\t&= \\\n\tx^{4\\cdot5} \t&= \\\n\tx^{20}\n}\n$$"
